151026/uploads/origins/61170b85-9af1-46bf-91bc-8c8a05941b71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4d0d0af77a43dfe1e98eadb3adf8cf95", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/53151026/uploads/origins/61170b85-9af1-46bf-91bc-8c8a05941b71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4d0d0af77a43dfe1e98eadb3adf8cf95, https://si.imgix.net/53151026/uploads/origins/61170b85-9af1-46bf-91bc-8c8a05941b71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a96cf0879008f638645cc386df1e2fb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/53151026/uploads/origins/61170b85-9af1-46bf-91bc-8c8a05941b71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d15a246f6f6845b500baada7091f4910 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "いつもお世話になっております！\n\n自キャラとフレのイラストをお願いします！\n白髪のキャラ（自キャラ）の方は頭に赤のフロンティアリボンをお願いします！青髪のキャラ（フレンド）の方はカーバンクルのお耳をお願いします！どちらも髪型はドーンブレイドです！\n\nリボンとカーバンクルの耳以外の部位の服装やポーズはお任せします。\n\nよろしくお願いいたしますー！！！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xl5Vz13rmepS1R1uoglXl0TwmRPpvyu8?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@furitter_/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/30ee6901/uploads/origins/89d3f40d-8911-46ab-a831-264f363f46a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=35cad83ec9a16551a9b863ddafa5c2bd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/30ee6901/uploads/origins/89d3f40d-8911-46ab-a831-264f363f46a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=35cad83ec9a16551a9b863ddafa5c2bd, https://si.imgix.net/30ee6901/uploads/origins/89d3f40d-8911-46ab-a831-264f363f46a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89b8d30206f6a47f2da500da2a8efb66 2x, https://si.imgix.net/30ee6901/uploads/origins/89d3f40d-8911-46ab-a831-264f363f46a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=039d87911fc3ac0ab383d9f58de94301 3x", "genre": "art", "n